  (base/place
   :name "Ethereal"
   :titles "Art, Ether, Etheral Plane, Etheral Realm, Infraspace, Impossible, Magic Realm, Negative Space, Nightmare, Subliminal Realm, Subreal, Subrealm, Subspace, Subverse, Surreal, Underrealm, Unreal, Unrealm"
   :summary
    "* The Etheral is the realm of the Spirit and of fates. It connects the Spirit realms.
     * Layers - Ethereal includes [Penumbra], [Infernal], [Tempest], [Void]
     * Description - The realm appears as a featureless realm of swirling mists.
     * Mind and Will - Everyone seems to experience the Ethereal differently with many experiencing wild and terrible hallicinations. Those entering this Realm with just their spirits find that their abilities are vastly increased. They are filled with a sense of power. They appear as a reflection of their inner selves with Body equal to Spirit and all abilities may use Spirit instead.
     * Body - Physical rules barely apply. Resistences use Spirit instead of Body.")
