   :name "Sandalton"
   :summary
    "* A small settlement nestled in [Sandalvale] surrounded by the [Sandal Forest] and near the towering [Mt. Murin].
     * The settlement is small, isolated and relatively poor. It was established to harvest [Sandalwood] trees and the oils they produces. Transporting the wood is difficult, so the settlement is more focused on trading oils, creams, and perfumes. Local wheat farming, breads, and goat and sheep herding make up the main diet.")
